  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> for which the tangent to the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is parallel to the line segment joining the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>S</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>The slope of a line joining the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus, the slope of the line segment joining the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Given, this line segment is parallel to the tangent of the curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and we know that the slope of the tangent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;also the slope of two parallel lines is same, hence&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Hence, the set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
}